' Agentic Enterprise value / operations boundary visualization
'
' Per CR-ES-010 §20 + ADR-ES-010 §5 + §14 + §15.
' Illustrates how Agentic Enterprise participates in value realisation and
' operations without collapsing into either.
'
' Authored by: Emmanuel A. Otchere (cardinal author rule, 2026-09-24)

@startuml agentic-enterprise-value-operations-boundary

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

skinparam rectangle {
    BackgroundColor #F0F8FF
    BorderColor #4682B4
    FontColor #000000
}

skinparam arrow {
    Color #2F4F4F
    FontColor #2F4F4F
}

title Agentic Enterprise ,  Value / Operations Boundary

rectangle "Agentic Enterprise" as ae #FFE4B5

rectangle "Value Realisation" as value #E0E8F0
rectangle "Agentic Value Stream" as avs #E6E6FA
rectangle "Operations" as ops #F0FFF0
rectangle "Agentic Operations" as aops #E0FFFF
rectangle "Agentic Workflow" as awf #FFFACD

ae --> value : participates
ae --> ops : participates

value --> avs : enterprise-realizes-through
ops --> aops : enterprise-operates-through
aops --> awf : uses

note bottom of ae
  Per AE-CON-004 + AE-CON-005 + AE-CON-013:
  Agentic Enterprise realises value through Agentic
  Value Streams and operates through Agentic Operations.
  Mixed realisation across agentic, conventional, and
  human-led operations is architecturally valid.
end note

@enduml
